+          "L2 uses simpleperf to point at a function and line; L3 takes heap snapshots and requires a human declaration that only test data is used. "
+          "A dashed shortcut takes failed memory checks from L0 straight to L3. Each layer stops when nothing abnormal is found, and everything is written into an evidence record that a script can rerun and a fresh AI checks blind.") if en else (
